OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F379A1783966787
OL,3,CEmma Raducanu starts grass season with
OL,4,Cconvincing Queen's win over Anna
OL,5,CBlinkova
OL,7,FEmma Raducanu was delighted to put
OL,8,Ftogether "the whole package" after
OL,9,Fopening her grass court season with a
OL,10,F6-0 6-3 win over Russian qualifier
OL,11,FAnna Blinkova at the HSBC
OL,12,FChampionships in London.
OL,14,FThe British number one only allowed
OL,15,FBlinkova six points across the entire
OL,16,Ffirst set and, despite a stronger
OL,17,Fsecond-set challenge from the world
OL,18,Fnumber 105, ultimately wrapped up the
OL,19,Fmatch in one hour.
