FL,380,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F379A1783966787
OL,3,CEmma Raducanu starts grass season with
OL,4,Cconvincing Queen's win over Anna
OL,5,CBlinkova
OL,7,F"I think it was a really good stepping
OL,8,Fstone," said Raducanu. "And I think
OL,9,Fthe way I was feeling on the court,
OL,10,Fthe way I was moving, the way I was
OL,11,Fexpressing myself, just the whole
OL,12,Fpackage, not necessarily the tennis,
OL,13,Fjust how I kind of was acting on the
OL,14,Fcourt, I really enjoyed it.
OL,16,F"I think that's something that I want
OL,17,Fto take forward in all of my matches
OL,18,Fand really embrace this grass court
OL,19,Fseason."
