OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F379A1783966787
OL,3,CEmma Raducanu starts grass season with
OL,4,Cconvincing Queen's win over Anna
OL,5,CBlinkova
OL,7,FRaducanu was looking for a first win
OL,8,Fsince beating Anastasia Zakharova at
OL,9,FIndian Wells in March.
OL,11,FIn May, Raducanu, who has cycled
OL,12,Fthrough a steady stream of coaches
OL,13,Fsince winning the US Open as a 2021
OL,14,Fqualifier, rehired Andrew Richardson,
OL,15,Fwho had guided her to that triumph.
OL,17,FShe has also suffered from the
OL,18,Flingering impact of a post-viral
OL,19,Fillness, missing two-and-a-half months
OL,20,Fof action before arriving in Paris,
OL,21,Fwhere she lost to Solana Sierra.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/7
