PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F379A1783966787
OL,3,CEmma Raducanu starts grass season with
OL,4,Cconvincing Queen's win over Anna
OL,5,CBlinkova
OL,7,FRaducanu reached the quarter-finals at
OL,8,FQueen's last year, when women's tennis
OL,9,Fwas played there for the first time
OL,10,Fsince 1973.
OL,12,FShe said she was hoping to return to a
OL,13,Fmore aggressive form of tennis ` with
OL,14,Fa focus on improving the beginning of
OL,15,Fpoints ` and got off to a strong
OL,16,Fstart, holding to love in the first
OL,17,Fgame and breaking Blinkova's serve for
OL,18,Fthe first time in the second.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
