OL,3,CEmma Raducanu starts grass season with
OL,4,Cconvincing Queen's win over Anna
OL,5,CBlinkova
OL,7,FRaducanu added: "I was really pleased
OL,8,Fwith how I came out and was playing
OL,9,Fvery free. I think I was just feeding
OL,10,Foff of the atmosphere and it felt
OL,11,Ffree, it felt clear and a lot of
OL,12,Fclarity.
OL,14,F"Not necessarily thinking too much,
OL,15,Fnot trying to do too much. It felt
OL,16,Fvery natural."
