PN,37907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F379A1783966787
OL,3,CEmma Raducanu starts grass season with
OL,4,Cconvincing Queen's win over Anna
OL,5,CBlinkova
OL,7,FIt took fellow Brit Katie Boulter
OL,8,Fsignificantly longer to upset Canada's
OL,9,FLeylah Fernandez ` the same woman
OL,10,FRaducanu beat in that US Open final `
OL,11,F3-6 7-6 (4) 7-5.
OL,13,FTheir encounter began on a rain-
OL,14,Fdelayed Monday and picked up again at
OL,15,Fthe Andy Murray Arena, where Boulter
OL,16,Fultimately fought back from a set and
OL,17,Fa break down to claim victory on home
OL,18,Fsoil in a two-hour, 45-minute battle.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/7
